#: ../../provisioning/code/repositories.rst:4
msgid "Repositories"
msgstr "Repositorios"

#: ../../provisioning/code/repositories.rst:6
msgid ""
"The :menuselection:`Provisioning --> Code --> Repositories` section "
"contains the repositories integrated with |morpheus| allowing users to "
"browse repository folders and files, view file contents from any branch, "
"trigger a refresh, and create tasks, scripts and templates directly from "
"the repos. This section also handles Import/Export functionality which "
"allows users to backup |morpheus| items (Tasks, Library Items, etc.) as "
"code in a repository which can also be imported into another appliance, "
"if desired."
msgstr ""
"El/La :menuselection:`Provisioning --> Code --> Repositories` sección "
"contiene el/la repositorios integrated con |morpheus| allowing usuarios a "
"browse repositorio folders y archivos, ver archivo contents desde cualquier "
"branch, trigger un refresh, y crear tareas, scripts y plantillas directly "
"desde el/la repos. Este sección also handles Import/Export funcionalidad "
"cual permite un los usuarios backup |morpheus| elementos (Tareas, Library "
"Elementos, etc.) as code en un repositorio cual puede also be importado en "
"another appliance, si desired."

